The successor consumed here has already been generated by the fixed
source/current action chain, and its complete nine-coordinate origin residual
has already been proved zero.  This module reads the physical content retained
by that same actual:

* exact P506/L0 lineage;
* the generated Stage-6 physical source-admission credential;
* all six nonzero physical sectors;
* the same-contact Cartan torsion--spin equality.

No residual coordinate, sign, support, branch, or zero-fiber witness enters a
constructor in this module.  The old fixed actual remains the negative
zero-fiber control.
-/

